<span id="S3.T2.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S3.T2.2.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">55 k+ dialogues; 3× faster than human; 80 % “friendly”; 32.4 % conversion</span>
</span></td></tr>
